const SECT={1:/Social Protection/,2:/Education/,3:/Health/,4:/Central Government|Public Administration - (Finance|Other)|Tax/,5:/Forestry|Environment|Flood|Disaster|Climate/,6:/Water|Sanitation/,7:/Agri|Food|Fishing|Irrigation|Livestock/,8:/Road|Transport|Rail|Port|Aviation/,9:/Energy|Solar|Renewable|Hydro|Power|Electric|Transmission|Thermal|Geothermal/,10:/ICT/,11:/ICT|Digital/,12:/Social|Banking|Finance/,13:/Social|Displac/,14:/Labor|Employment|SME|Private/,15:/Private|Banking|Capital Markets|Finance/};
function quantile(arr,q){const s=[...arr].sort((a,b)=>a-b);if(!s.length)return 0;const pos=(s.length-1)*q,lo=Math.floor(pos),hi=Math.ceil(pos);return s[lo]+(s[hi]-s[lo])*(pos-lo);}
function needIndicator(o){let best=null;for(const c of o.context){const n=Object.keys(D.CTX).filter(a=>isCountry(a)&&D.CTX[a][c.code]).length;if(!best||n>best.n)best={c,n};}return best&&best.c;}
function researchData(o,r){
  const need=needIndicator(o),neg=need&&NEG.test(need.name),popShare=need&&need.unit==='Percentage'&&/population|people/i.test(need.name),sect=SECT[o.n];
  const rows=Object.keys(D.names).filter(isCountry).map(a=>{const v=(D.R[a]||{})[r.code],s=need&&(D.CTX[a]||{})[need.code],y=s?Object.keys(s).at(-1):null,ctx=s?s[y]:null,pop=(D.POP[a]||[])[1]??null;
    const pr=((D.PR||{})[r.code]||{})[a],act=sect?(D.ACTIVE||[]).filter(x=>x[0]===a&&sect.test(x[2])):[];
    const peopleNeed=popShare&&ctx!=null&&pop?(neg?pop*ctx/100:pop*(100-ctx)/100):null;
    return{key:a,label:areaName(a),region:regionOf(a),fcv:D.names[a][3]==='Y',ach:v?v[0]:null,exp:v?v[1]:null,gap:v&&v[0]!=null?v[1]-v[0]:null,ratio:v&&v[0]!=null&&v[1]>0?v[0]/v[1]:null,
      ctx,ctxYear:y,pop,peopleNeed,nProj:pr?pr[0]:0,cmt:pr?pr[1]:0,nActive:act.length,cmtActive:act.reduce((s,x)=>s+x[1],0)};}).filter(x=>x.exp!=null||x.ctx!=null);
  const withRes=rows.filter(x=>x.exp>0&&x.ratio!=null),thr=quantile(withRes.map(x=>x.exp),0.6);
  const accelerate=withRes.filter(x=>x.exp>=thr&&x.ratio<0.4).sort((a,b)=>b.gap-a.gap).slice(0,4);
  const accSet=new Set(accelerate.map(x=>x.key));
  const nrows=rows.filter(x=>x.peopleNeed!=null).map(x=>({...x,coverage:(x.exp||0)/x.peopleNeed}));
  const expand=(popShare?nrows.filter(x=>x.coverage<0.25&&!accSet.has(x.key)).sort((a,b)=>b.peopleNeed-a.peopleNeed):rows.filter(x=>x.ctx!=null&&!accSet.has(x.key)&&!(x.exp>0)).sort((a,b)=>(neg?b.ctx-a.ctx:a.ctx-b.ctx))).slice(0,4);
  const strong=withRes.filter(x=>x.ratio>=0.75&&x.exp>=quantile(withRes.map(x=>x.exp),0.5)).sort((a,b)=>b.ach-a.ach).slice(0,2);
  const reg=REGIONS.map(k=>{const rr=rows.filter(x=>x.region===k);return{key:k,label:REG[k],need:rr.reduce((s,x)=>s+(x.peopleNeed||0),0),gap:((D.R[k]||{})[r.code]||[0,0]).reduce((a,b,i)=>i?b-a:a,0)};});
  const totNeed=reg.reduce((s,x)=>s+x.need,0),topReg=[...reg].sort((a,b)=>b.need-a.need)[0];
  return{need,neg,popShare,rows,accelerate,expand,strong,reg,totNeed,topReg,sect,
    sources:{results:withRes.length,ctx:rows.filter(x=>x.ctx!=null).length,pop:rows.filter(x=>x.pop).length,pr:rows.filter(x=>x.nProj).length,cmt:rows.reduce((s,x)=>s+x.cmt,0),active:rows.reduce((s,x)=>s+x.nActive,0),cmtActive:rows.reduce((s,x)=>s+x.cmtActive,0)}};}
function openResearch(n,q){$('home-answer').style.display='none';openOutcome(n);addMsg('user',q||'Which areas and countries should we prioritize in a three-year plan, and where are the biggest gaps or opportunities?');runResearch();}
function runResearch(){const{o,r}=cur(),R=researchData(o,r),u=r.unit;
  const steps=[['database','Scorecard results by country',`get_results(${r.code}, COUNTRY, FY${S.fy.slice(2)}) → ${R.sources.results} countries with results`],
