    <li><b>Accelerate delivery</b> where portfolios are large but behind (achieved below 40% of expected): ${R.accelerate.map(x=>`${x.label} (${c(Math.round(x.ratio*100)+'%',x.key,'ratio, computed',x.ratio*100)} of ${c(fmt(x.exp,u),x.key,'expected',x.exp)})`).join(', ')||'none flagged'}. Focus: implementation support, procurement and connection bottlenecks.</li>
    <li><b>Expand the footprint</b> where need far exceeds the pipeline: ${R.expand.map(x=>`${x.label} (${needTxt(x)}; expected results ${x.exp?c(fmt(x.exp,u),x.key,'expected',x.exp):'none reported'})`).join(', ')||'none flagged'}. These are the largest opportunities for new operations or scale-up.</li>
    ${R.strong.length?`<li><b>Learn from strong delivery:</b> ${R.strong.map(x=>`${x.label} (${c(Math.round(x.ratio*100)+'%',x.key,'ratio, computed',x.ratio*100)})`).join(', ')}.</li>`:''}
   </ol>
   <div><b>Biggest gap overall:</b> ${c(fmt(tot[1]-tot[0],u),'ACW','remaining gap, computed',tot[1]-tot[0])} of expected results are still to be delivered (${c(Math.round(tot[0]/tot[1]*100)+'%','ACW','ratio, computed',tot[0]/tot[1]*100)} achieved).</div>
   <div class="how"><details><summary>Method & caveats</summary>Results: Scorecard FY${fy}, WBG totals by country. Need: ${R.need?R.need.code:''} (latest year). Population: Data360 WDI. Footprint: Scorecard project-level contributions (World Bank only, not IFC/MIGA) and active projects from the World Bank Projects API matched by sector name (approximate; whole-project commitments). "Expected" = active portfolio, not a corporate target; beneficiaries may include improved existing connections, so coverage vs need is indicative.</details></div>`);
